msgid "Administrative Documentation"
msgstr "Administratiewe dokumentasie"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Tuisblad"

msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentasie"

msgid "Bookmarklets"
msgstr "Bladmerkletsel"

msgid "Documentation bookmarklets"
msgstr "Dokumentasie bladmerke"

msgid ""
"To install bookmarklets, drag the link to your bookmarks toolbar, or right-"
"click the link and add it to your bookmarks. Now you can select the "
"bookmarklet from any page in the site."
msgstr ""

msgid "Documentation for this page"
msgstr "Dokumentasie vir dié bladsy"

msgid ""
"Jumps you from any page to the documentation for the view that generates "
"that page."
msgstr ""
"Spring jou van enige bladsy na die dokumentasie vir die uitsig wat daardie "
"bladsy genereer."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Merk"

msgid "List of all the template tags and their functions."
msgstr "Lys van al die template-tags en hul funksies."

msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filters"

msgid ""
"Filters are actions which can be applied to variables in a template to alter "
"the output."
msgstr ""
"Filters is aksies wat op veranderlikes in 'n sjabloon toegepas kan word om "
"die uitgang te verander."

msgid "Models"
msgstr "Modelle"

msgid ""
"Models are descriptions of all the objects in the system and their "
"associated fields. Each model has a list of fields which can be accessed as "
"template variables"
msgstr ""
"Modelle is beskrywings van al die voorwerpe in die stelsel en hul "
"gepaardgaande velde. Elke model het 'n lys van velde wat as "
"sjabloonvariabeles toeganklik is"

msgid "Views"
msgstr "Besigthede"

msgid ""
"Each page on the public site is generated by a view. The view defines which "
"template is used to generate the page and which objects are available to "
"that template."
msgstr ""
"Elke bladsy op die publieke webwerf word deur 'n weergawe gegenereer. Die "
"weergawe bepaal watter sjabloon gebruik word om die bladsy te genereer en "
"watter voorwerpe beskikbaar is vir daardie sjabloon."

msgid "Tools for your browser to quickly access admin functionality."
msgstr ""
"Hulpmiddels vir jou blaaier om vinnig toegang tot administrateur "
"funksionaliteit te verkry."

msgid "Please install docutils"
msgstr "Installeer asseblief docutils"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The admin documentation system requires Python's <a href=\"%(link)s"
"\">docutils</a> library."
msgstr ""
"Die administratordokumentasiesysteem vereis Python se <a href=\"%(link)s\""
">docutils</a> biblioteek."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Please ask your administrators to install <a href=\"%(link)s\">docutils</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vra asseblief jou administrators om <a href=\"%(link)s\">docutils</a> te "
"installeer."

